ascension-path-given = Heaven is watching this station. You hold a Fork in the Road: use it in hand to choose the path of qi or the path of the body. The first to reach the peak rules over everyone.
ascension-path-qi-tip = The Path of Qi: you awaken at once and can meditate. Your element (metal, wood, water, fire or earth) comes from the first manual you find and read. Faster to start, frailer in the body.
ascension-path-body-tip = The Path of the Body: you commit at once and can start forging. Temper flesh and bone through nine stages until nothing can hurt you. Slower and harder, but far tougher and deadlier up close. You can never cultivate qi.
ascension-peak-announcement = Heaven trembles: {$winner} has reached the peak of cultivation and stands above everyone aboard as the Supreme Sovereign. Pray they are merciful.
ascension-peak-self = You stand at the peak of cultivation, the Supreme Sovereign of this station. Blows land on you at three-quarter strength. Settle every score before the shuttle comes.
ascension-round-end-winner = {$winner} reached the peak of cultivation first and was proclaimed Supreme Sovereign.
ascension-round-end-none = Nobody reached the peak of cultivation.
roles-antag-ks-ascension-qi-name = Qi Cultivator
roles-antag-ks-ascension-body-name = Body Cultivator
roles-antag-ks-ascension-objective = Reach the peak of cultivation (Nascent Soul, or the ninth stage of the body) before anyone else. Everyone aboard is racing you; settle scores however you like.
ascension-chose-qi = Qi stirs in your meridians: you have awakened. Meditate to gather qi and insight, and find a cultivation manual to take up an element's law.
cultivator-path-given = You hold a Fork in the Road: use it in hand to walk the path of qi or the path of the body. The jianghu does not forgive the weak.
